"2026-10-30","zh":"Pinterest 發布悲觀的第三季業績，加入英特爾、Roblox、Twilio 和其他大型股票週五走低的行列"},{"title":"Twilio Sinks 17% on Slowing Q4 Growth Guide as Beat Turns “More Modest and More Normalized”","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNRDdOdWU5Yk10MkVFcXJWSmJ0QWRQbzZydWRIQmc0eFJOaVlyb2hWWnZnVXplaW4tSXFrcDNGUWpQMFkwT0FIUE5aRTNEc2RKVlUtNFhxR3FmTGpfdWV6dURwTEZaVG4tT0h6bHc0ck9OMEZORzFZSGV4cXRXYkdZanAxV0pjU0VGQ1lfTl93c0x0N2pPS1hCbEdRb2ZMZFdiLXFvZHVXdGVnNVh5NVJ6ZWtSdWlYWnFEcTVrMWJCVGVKbzVFSVJNeWM2VQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"隨著節拍變得“更加溫和、更加正常化”，Twilio 因第四季度增長放緩而下跌 17%"},{"title":"TWLO Q3 deep dive: messaging deceleration and AI adoption shape outlook","src":"StockStory","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPZThYWGVuR25TLTZCSXRVamF2a2JBUWdGbndEQjl4MTBfVkN6NDk2aWJDdWlUaVhXaVhSRzVKTkowdFUtSEIwNXFJM1E4TDdGSzJrb0dKQVJUZWhiaHh2T25QdUdTSko0bGxLUlVROFl5SnYtU1ljdWY1eXRHV0Y3NFoxS1FvTGE2YTBjSWNJaldIOUg1dTZHZHFpZkNuVk1rcGpxMWl6QzRuc01jLXdQaktMTUg1Wk9jcnF3WEhzaEhMYWJhLW1PX3J6Umk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"TWLO 第三季深入探討：訊息傳遞減速與人工智慧採用塑造前景"},{"title":"What Twilio (NYSE:TWLO) Holders Need to Understand About the 22% Decline After Third-Quarter Results and Fourth-Quarter Guidance","src":"kalkine.ca","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Twilio（NYSE：TWLO）持有人需要了解第三季業績和第四季度指引後下跌 22% 的情況"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1447669/000144766926000021/twlo-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We envision a world in which every digital interaction is amazing. By combining our leading communications capabilities with rich contextual data and artificial intelligence (\"AI\"), we provide the infrastructure for businesses of all sizes to revolutionize how they engage with their customers by delivering seamless, trusted, and personalized customer experiences at scale.","zh":"我們設想一個每一次數位互動都令人驚嘆的世界。透過將我們領先的通訊能力與豐富的上下文資料和人工智慧 (“AI”) 相結合，我們為各種規模的企業提供基礎設施，透過大規模提供無縫、可信賴和個人化的客戶體驗，徹底改變他們與客戶的互動方式。"},{"en":"We offer highly customizable communications application programming interfaces (\"APIs\") that enable developers to embed numerous forms of messaging, voice, email, and video interactions into their customer-facing applications, as well as software products that target specific engagement needs, including our digital engagement centers, marketing campaigns, and user authentication and identity solutions. This combination of flexible APIs and software solutions, together with our customer data capabilities, helps businesses of all sizes and across numerous industries to benefit from smarter and more streamlined engagement at every step of the customer journey, including reduced customer acquisition costs, lasting loyalty, and increased customer value. The value proposition of our offerings has become stronger and our products have become more strategic to our customers as businesses are inc","zh":"我們提供高度可自訂的通訊應用程式介面（「API」），使開發人員能夠將多種形式的訊息傳遞、語音、電子郵件和視訊互動嵌入到面向客戶的應用程式中，以及針對特定參與需求的軟體產品，包括我們的數位參與中心、行銷活動以及用戶身份驗證和身分解決方案。靈活的 API 和軟體解決方案的結合，加上我們的客戶資料功能，可以幫助各種規模和跨多個行業的企業在客戶旅程的每一步中從更聰明、更簡化的參與中受益，包括降低客戶獲取成本、持久忠誠度和提高客戶價值。隨著企業的發展，我們產品的價值主張變得更強大，我們的產品對客戶來說也變得更具策略性。"},{"en":"We have experienced substantial growth in our business since inception, and as of December 31, 2025, we had over 402,000 Active Customer Accounts representing organizations from small and medium-sized businesses to large enterprises across a broad range of industries. Our growth has predominantly been organic as a result of new customer acquisition, as well as customers increasing their usage of our products, extending their usage of our products to new applications, or adopting new products that we offer. We have also fueled our growth through strategic acquisitions and integrations of businesses that complemented our pre-existing products and allowed us to expand our platform and to add new customer accounts.","zh":"自成立以來，我們的業務取得了大幅成長，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有超過 402,000 個活躍客戶帳戶，代表各行各業的中小型企業到大型企業的組織。我們的成長主要是由於新客戶的獲取以及客戶增加對我們產品的使用、將我們產品的使用擴展到新應用或採用我們提供的新產品而實現的。我們也透過策略性收購和業務整合來推動我們的成長，這些業務補充了我們現有的產品，並使我們能夠擴展我們的平台並添加新的客戶帳戶。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our sales and marketing teams work closely together to drive awareness and adoption of our platform. We leverage our brand, marketing programs, and conferences, such as SIGNAL, to expand our go-to-market motions. Our go-to-market model has three motions: self-service, sales-led, and partner-led.","zh":"我們的銷售和行銷團隊緊密合作，以提高我們平台的知名度和採用率。我們利用我們的品牌、行銷計劃和會議（例如 SIGNAL）來擴大我們的行銷活動。我們的上市模式包含三個動作：自助服務、銷售主導和合作夥伴主導。"},{"en":"Developers and other technical customers are able to access our easy-to-configure APIs and tools along with our extensive self-service documentation and customer support team, to embed our products into their applications. These self-service customers can then provide their billing information to either make an upfront prepayment that is drawn down as they use our products, or subscribe to a plan, depending on the product they deploy.","zh":"開發人員和其他技術客戶能夠存取我們易於配置的 API 和工具以及我們廣泛的自助服務文件和客戶支援團隊，將我們的產品嵌入到他們的應用程式中。然後，這些自助服務客戶可以提供他們的帳單資訊，以便在使用我們的產品時支付預付款，或者訂閱計劃，具體取決於他們部署的產品。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for our products are rapidly evolving and are increasingly competitive. Our competitors are primarily (i) communications platform-as-a-service (\"CPaaS\") companies that offer communications products and applications, (ii) regional network service providers that offer limited developer functionality on top of their own physical infrastructure, (iii) customer relationship management and customer experience vendors, (iv) standalone customer data platform vendors and (v) other software companies that compete with portions of our product line.","zh":"我們產品的市場正在快速發展，競爭也日益激烈。我們的競爭對手主要是（i）提供通訊產品和應用程式的通訊平台即服務（「CPaaS」）公司，（ii）在其自己的實體基礎設施之上提供有限開發人員功能的區域網路服務供應商，（iii）客戶關係管理和客戶體驗供應商，（iv）獨立客戶資料平台供應商以及（v）與我們部分產品線競爭的其他軟體公司。"},{"en":"The principal competitive factors in these markets include completeness of offering, credibility with customers, ability to differentiate our products against competing offerings, global reach, ease of integration and programmability, product features, platform scalability, reliability, deliverability, security and performance, brand awareness and reputation, the strength of sales and marketing efforts, customer support, and the cost of deploying and using products.","zh":"這些市場的主要競爭因素包括產品的完整性、客戶的可信度、使我們的產品與競爭產品區分開來的能力、全球影響力、易於整合和可編程性、產品功能、平台可擴展性、可靠性、可交付性、安全性和性能、品牌知名度和聲譽、銷售和行銷工作的實力、客戶支援以及部署和使用產品的成本。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Messaging","val":2878304000,"zh":"訊息傳遞"},{"name":"Other Communications","val":746541000,"zh":"其他通訊"},{"name":"Programmable Voice","val":615655000,"zh":"可程式語音"},{"name":"Email","val":523470000,"zh":"電子郵件"},{"name":"Segment","val":303250000,"zh":"部門"}],"total":5067220000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3246863000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1820357000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":5067220000}},"peers":["OKTA","DOCU","TTD","ROKU","DDOG"]}}